WEBVTT

00:16:58.000 --> 00:17:00.176
a richly textured life

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:02.240
on a much more modest income.

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:06.336
So I am calling on change agents

00:17:06.359 --> 00:17:08.415
and social entrepreneurs,

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:10.296
artists and elders

00:17:10.319 --> 00:17:11.816
and impact investors.

00:17:11.839 --> 00:17:16.480
I'm calling on developers
and disrupters of the status quo.

00:17:17.079 --> 00:17:19.599
We need you to help us imagine

00:17:21.760 --> 00:17:27.215
how to invest in the services
and products and infrastructure

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:29.736
that will support our dignity,

00:17:29.760 --> 00:17:32.936
our independence and our well-being